<title>USA: ProxyMed buys back 110,000 shares.</title>
<headline>ProxyMed buys back 110,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProxyMed Inc said Thursday it bought back 110,000 shares of its common stock on the open market on April 11, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it had roughly 7.66 million shares outstanding at the end of 1996.</p>
</text>
